[00:28:05.703] Browser LOG     products: [{"category":{"id":"38a64c65-23ed-4af2-a9ce-88e2ba9c1fe9","name":"Smart Gadgets"},"categoryId":"38a64c65-23ed-4af2-a9ce-88e2ba9c1fe9","createdAt":"2025-12-05T08:11:17.063Z","description":"Touchscreen Charge Case – Control calls, mute, ANC, and pairing directly from the smart case.\r\nSeamless PC & Mobile Connectivity – Connect to PCs (via BT700 adapter), smartphones, and tablets effortlessly.\r\nQi Wireless Charging – Convenient wireless charging support for the case.\r\nBT700 USB Bluetooth Adapter – Enables long-range (up to 98 ft) stable connections to laptops and desktops.\r\nSix-Microphone Array + WindSmart – Enhanced call clarity with advanced noise suppression.\r\nAdaptive Hybrid ANC – Blocks distractions with adjustable noise cancellation modes.\r\nPoly NoiseBlockAI – Reduces background noise intelligently for professional calls.\r\nMultipoint Pairing – Connect and switch between multiple devices (PC, Android, iPhone).\r\nLong Battery Life – Up to 5.5 hrs of use per charge, with 16 hrs additional playback from the case.\r\nUC Platform Certified – Optimized for Teams, Zoom, Google Meet, and more.","discountPercentage":null,"id":"ca245792-5cf3-4c71-b229-73b68a4222b8","imageUrls":["https://pub-35c12dbcf31e4b769c72ed554b2e702d.r2.dev/products/1764922276505-no0uw5g5thh.webp"],"isActive":true,"label":null,"name":"Poly   Voyager   Free   60   UC   -   Touchscreen   True   Wireless   Earbuds","oldPrice":null,"price":33999,"stock":20,"updatedAt":"2025-12-06T05:47:29.336Z"},{"category":{"id":"38a64c65-23ed-4af2-a9ce-88e2ba9c1fe9","name":"Smart Gadgets"},"categoryId":"38a64c65-23ed-4af2-a9ce-88e2ba9c1fe9","createdAt":"2025-12-05T08:02:43.550Z","description":"Steerable Two‑Mic Array – Microphone pickup up to 5 ft (1.5 m), focusing on voice while minimizing background noise.\r\nFull‑Duplex Audio – Enables natural, two-way conversations without interruptions.\r\n50 mm Speaker + Dual Passive Radiators – Delivers high-fidelity sound s